OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786814280
OL,3,CDover care home rated as inadequate
OL,4,Cafter inspection by care watchdog
OL,6,FA care home in Dover has been rated as
OL,7,Finadequate after a review by the care
OL,8,Fwatchdog.
OL,10,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) said
OL,11,Fit had downgraded Temple Ewell Nursing
OL,12,FHome's rating from good because its
OL,13,Fservices had "deteriorated".
OL,15,FInspectors also found the home was "in
OL,16,Fbreach" of seven regulations,
OL,17,Fincluding staffing, recruitment and
OL,18,Fsafeguarding.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
