CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786814280
OL,3,CDover care home rated as inadequate
OL,4,Cafter inspection by care watchdog
OL,6,FTemple Ewell Nursing Home said it's
OL,7,Fit's "implemented robust action
OL,8,Fplans", in the wake of the inspection,
OL,9,Fand is "fully committed to delivering
OL,10,Fthe high-quality care that our
OL,11,Fresidents and their families deserve".
OL,13,FThe CQC's decision means the home has
OL,14,Fnow been placed into special measures
OL,15,Fand will be closely monitored to
OL,16,Fensure residents are safe while
OL,17,Fimprovements are made.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
