PN,38803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786814280
OL,3,CDover care home rated as inadequate
OL,4,Cafter inspection by care watchdog
OL,6,FCatriona Eglinton, CQC's deputy
OL,7,Fdirector for adult social care in
OL,8,FKent, said the inspection discovered a
OL,9,F"failure of leadership to identify and
OL,10,Fact on risk".
OL,12,FShe said: "Leaders accepted a culture
OL,13,Fthat incidents would happen, rather
OL,14,Fthan asking why they were happening
OL,15,Fand what could be done to prevent
OL,16,Fthem."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
