OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786814280
OL,3,CDover care home rated as inadequate
OL,4,Cafter inspection by care watchdog
OL,6,FTemple Ewell Nursing Home said in a
OL,7,Fstatement: "The care, safety, and well-
OL,8,Fbeing of our residents remain our
OL,9,Fabsolute highest priority, and we
OL,10,Fcontinue to be deeply honoured to care
OL,11,Ffor everyone in our home.
OL,13,F"Following the CQC's inspection in
OL,14,FMay, we took immediate and decisive
OL,15,Faction.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
